1
00:00:00,465 --> 00:00:03,675
l should have sent you to the custom
car cover place in AItadena.

2
00:00:03,843 --> 00:00:05,673
(Howard:)They have her pattern on file.

3
00:00:07,138 --> 00:00:08,718
Ha-ha. Humorous.

4
00:00:09,474 --> 00:00:13,184
(Sheldon:)Now, will you please present
my paper to Professor Hawking?

5
00:00:13,353 --> 00:00:15,683
- l don't know.
- Oh, for heaven's sake.

6
00:00:15,855 --> 00:00:19,025
l did your laundry.
l pee-pee-proofed your beIt buckles.

7
00:00:19,192 --> 00:00:23,572
l even sprained my wrist
helping your mother lift her bosom.

8
00:00:28,493 --> 00:00:32,033
(Howard:)All right, Sheldon. There's only
one thing left I want you to do.

9
00:00:32,205 --> 00:00:35,205
(Howard:)- Don't worry, it's an easy one.
- Okay.

10
00:00:35,708 --> 00:00:37,038
(Howard:)Give me a compliment.

11
00:00:37,877 --> 00:00:39,207
(Penny:)Fine.

12
00:00:39,379 --> 00:00:40,959
(Sheldon:)You have very tiny hands.

13
00:00:44,509 --> 00:00:46,719
(Howard:)No. About my job.

14
00:00:46,886 --> 00:00:50,346
l want you to tell me
I'm good at what I do.

15
00:00:51,057 --> 00:00:53,017
(Sheldon:)You're obviously good
at what you do.

16
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:56,104
(Howard:)Well, then, why are you always ripping
on me?

17
00:00:56,270 --> 00:00:57,770
(Sheldon:)Oh, I understand the confusion.

